[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4200929439","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118282#issuecomment-4200929439","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118282","id":4200929439,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76ZRif","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-07T17:20:18Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T17:20:18Z","body":"@jrouwe I must admit this behavior surprised me, and might even be a bug in Jolt itself. Is it really supposed to be calling `OnContactAdded` for soft body collisions?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4200929439/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4201860341","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118282#issuecomment-4201860341","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118282","id":4201860341,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76c0z1","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-07T20:04:08Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T20:04:08Z","body":"I don't think that was the intention. I think it's supposed to be filtered out by this:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/jrouwe/JoltPhysics/blob/e2fb3a21eaf45f6f4037f235b193eeae50e6ff0a/Jolt/Physics/PhysicsSystem.cpp#L1994-L1996\r\n\r\nLet me check what's going on before merging this PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4201860341/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4209427772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118282#issuecomment-4209427772","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118282","id":4209427772,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc765sU8","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-08T20:31:15Z","updated_at":"2026-04-08T20:31:15Z","body":"I had 2 seconds to look at this yesterday: The check that I spoke of is an `IsSensor` check and not an `IsSoftBody` check (oops). The fact that it calls `OnContactAdded` works strictly speaking but was more of an accident than a deliberate choice (you can also get `OnContactPersisted` and `OnContactRemoved` calllbacks). I will reroute these calls to `OnSoftBodyContactValidate` which I will probably have to split up in a 'validate' and a 'get contact settings' call because of the way things are split up in the CCD pipeline. I'll try to get that done this weekend.\r\n\r\nUnless there's a real hurry to fix this, I would close this PR and then I'll open another one with a patch in Jolt.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4209427772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4209732934","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118282#issuecomment-4209732934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118282","id":4209732934,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76621G","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-08T21:19:15Z","updated_at":"2026-04-08T21:19:15Z","body":"> Unless there's a real hurry to fix this, I would close this PR and then I'll open another one with a patch in Jolt.\r\n\r\nThat's totally fine. This was just something I ran into while testing #118236.\r\n\r\nAlso, I wasn't getting any actual crashes outside of ASan builds, but I suppose it's not impossible. If we happen to always be reading valid memory during `JoltBody3D::reports_contacts`, then at most it'll just emit errors in `JoltContactListener3D::_flush_contacts`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4209732934/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]